  "summary": "The product is a JetBrains IDE plugin integrating the OpenCode open-source AI coding agent into the development workflow. Quick Launch opens a connection dialog via Cmd+Esc (Mac) or Ctrl+\\ (Win/Linux), letting users connect to an existing OpenCode server by host:port with optional password, or create a new local terminal session on default port 127.0.0.1:4096.",
